g hasStorageLocation on the outfit shape or relocating it to the ship."],"current_feedback":"The owner repair is incomplete. Although nltl:equipmentItem now has a storage-location shape, the nltl:hasFirefighterOutfit branch does not require each firefighterOutfitItem to be the equipmentItem owner governed by that shape; the separate ship-level nltl:hasEquipmentItem branch is independent and permits the outfit to lack any storage constraint. Qualify the hasFirefighterOutfit object with the equipmentItem storage constraint, or encode an explicit supplied path linking each firefighterOutfitItem to its required equipmentItem owner, without duplicating hasStorageLocation on the outfit or relocating it to the ship. Retain the physicalStorageLocation warmStorageLocation check.","blocking":false,"semantic_attempt_consumed":false}
